WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.070
Canada is home to 10% of the world's

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.872
most top cited researchers,

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:08.008
many of whom are right here in Alberta.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.744
I see the high caliber of AI talent here

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.078
every day at Amii

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.179
where our researchers,

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:14.481
staff and students

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:16.483
set out to do ambitious things.

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:17.684
The driving forces

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.119
for the current wave of AI

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.721
were pioneered right here in Canada,

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:22.922
so it's no wonder that

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.290
international talent

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.692
from around the world

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.360
want to come to Canada

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.862
to learn and study

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.530
under the best and brightest.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.998
What's really exciting for me

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.900
is how Canada's three National AI Institues

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.069
work with industry partners.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.405
From start ups to large industry,

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.606
we work with companies

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:40.573
to be able to help them

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.242
identify where AI can be

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.543
used in their business

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.912
in responsible and useful ways,

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:46.513
helping them

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:47.747
train their workforce

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:50.750
and continue to grow Canadian AI talent.

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:53.386
It's fantastic to watch industry

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.721
learn from our researchers

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.990
and our researchers learn from industry

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.858
about what their needs are

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.294
so we can turn fundamental research

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.129
into real world opportunity.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.231
This is what excites me about

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.099
Canadian AI talent.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:07.801
We're continuing to build the future

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:08.868
and we're just getting started.

